      "assertionKind": "summary",
      "index": 0,
      "documentSlug": "diet-and-nutrition-in-pd-mediterranean-mind-protein-redistribution-ketogenic",
      "documentConcept": "Diet and nutrition in PD: Mediterranean, MIND, protein redistribution, ketogenic",
      "canonicalConceptId": "concept:2b1fbcf4e51fa270f627bec5ee696a38c4a947789b2f4aa8a1c15fceb4b55376",
      "text": "Mediterranean and MIND patterns are plausible supportive dietary approaches in Parkinson\u2019s disease, but observational associations cannot establish slower progression. A small Mediterranean trial reported short-term cognitive-test improvements. Protein redistribution may help levodopa-related motor fluctuations, with nutritional and dyskinesia monitoring. Ketogenic pilots suggest possible nonmotor benefits, without established motor superiority or long-term safety. Nutritional adequacy and individualized medication\u2013meal planning remain practical priorities; protocol publications and preliminary associations must not be presented as proven disease modification.",
